{"seq":4,"slug":"evaluation-metrics","title":"生成质量评估指标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/generative-foundations/evaluation-metrics","wordCount":1779,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"生成质量评估指标\">生成质量评估指标</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>生成模型的评估是一个多维度的复杂问题。与分类或回归任务有明确的ground truth不同，生成质量的衡量涉及保真度（生成样本是否真实）、多样性（生成样本是否覆盖数据分布的所有模式）和条件一致性（生成结果是否符合输入条件）三个维度。没有单一指标能够全面衡量生成质量，实践中需要综合多个指标进行评估。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[生成质量评估] --&gt; B[保真度]&#10;    A --&gt; C[多样性]&#10;    A --&gt; D[条件一致性]&#10;    B --&gt; E[FID]&#10;    B --&gt; F[IS]&#10;    C --&gt; G[Recall]&#10;    C --&gt; H[Coverage]&#10;    D --&gt; I[CLIP Score]&#10;    D --&gt; J[R-Precision]&#10;    E --&gt; K[综合评估]&#10;    G --&gt; K&#10;    I --&gt; K\">graph TD\n    A[生成质量评估] --&gt; B[保真度]\n    A --&gt; C[多样性]\n    A --&gt; D[条件一致性]\n    B --&gt; E[FID]\n    B --&gt; F[IS]\n    C --&gt; G[Recall]\n    C --&gt; H[Coverage]\n    D --&gt; I[CLIP Score]\n    D --&gt; J[R-Precision]\n    E --&gt; K[综合评估]\n    G --&gt; K\n    I --&gt; K</pre><p>评估生成模型的挑战在于我们需要比较两个分布——真实数据分布和模型生成的分布——而不是逐样本比较。这要求评估指标具有分布级别的统计特性，同时对有限样本量保持鲁棒性。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>衡量维度</th>\n<th>计算方式</th>\n<th>值域</th>\n<th>越低越好/越高越好</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>FID</td>\n<td>保真度+多样性</td>\n<td>特征空间 Fréchet 距离</td>\n<td>[0, +∞)</td>\n<td>越低越好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IS</td>\n<td>保真度+多样性</td>\n<td>条件熵与边际熵的 KL</td>\n<td>[1, +∞)</td>\n<td>越高越好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Precision</td>\n<td>保真度</td>\n<td>生成样本落入真实流形比例</td>\n<td>[0, 1]</td>\n<td>越高越好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Recall</td>\n<td>多样性</td>\n<td>真实样本被生成流形覆盖比例</td>\n<td>[0, 1]</td>\n<td>越高越好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CLIP Score</td>\n<td>文图一致性</td>\n<td>CLIP 余弦相似度</td>\n<td>[-1, 1]</td>\n<td>越高越好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LPIPS</td>\n<td>感知相似度</td>\n<td>深度特征距离</td>\n<td>[0, +∞)</td>\n<td>取决于任务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"fr-chet-inception-distance\">Fréchet Inception Distance</h2><p>FID（Fréchet Inception Distance）是目前最广泛使用的生成质量指标。它将真实图像和生成图像分别通过预训练的 Inception-v3 网络提取特征，然后计算两组特征的 Fréchet 距离（也称 Wasserstein-2 距离）。FID 假设两组特征服从多元高斯分布，并通过均值和协方差矩阵计算分布间距离。</p>\n<p>FID = ||μ_r - μ_g||² + Tr(Σ_r + Σ_g - 2(Σ_r·Σ_g)^{1/2})，其中下标 r 和 g 分别表示真实和生成样本。FID 的优势在于同时捕获保真度和多样性：均值项反映两个分布中心的偏移（与保真度相关），协方差项反映分布形状的差异（与多样性相关）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import numpy as np&#10;from scipy import linalg&#10;import torch&#10;from torchvision.models import inception_v3&#10;&#10;def compute_fid(real_features, gen_features):&#10;    mu_r = np.mean(real_features, axis=0)&#10;    mu_g = np.mean(gen_features, axis=0)&#10;    sigma_r = np.cov(real_features, rowvar=False)&#10;    sigma_g = np.cov(gen_features, rowvar=False)&#10;    diff = mu_r - mu_g&#10;    covmean, _ = linalg.sqrtm(sigma_r @ sigma_g, disp=False)&#10;    if np.iscomplexobj(covmean):&#10;        covmean = covmean.real&#10;    fid = diff @ diff + np.trace(sigma_r + sigma_g - 2 * covmean)&#10;    return fid&#10;&#10;def extract_inception_features(images, model, device=&#39;cuda&#39;):&#10;    model.eval()&#10;    features = []&#10;    with torch.no_grad():&#10;        for batch in images:&#10;            batch = batch.to(device)&#10;            feat = model(batch)&#10;            features.append(feat.cpu().numpy())&#10;    return np.concatenate(features)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scipy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> linalg</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torchvision.models </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inception_v3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> compute_fid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(real_features, gen_features):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    mu_r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.mean(real_features, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">axis</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    mu_g </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.mean(gen_features, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">axis</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    sigma_r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.cov(real_features, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">rowvar</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">False</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    sigma_g </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.cov(gen_features, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">rowvar</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">False</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    diff </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mu_r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mu_g</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    covmean, _ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> linalg.sqrtm(sigma_r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sigma_g, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">disp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">False</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.iscomplexobj(covmean):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        covmean </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> covmean.real</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    fid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> diff </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> diff </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.trace(sigma_r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sigma_g </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> covmean)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fid</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> extract_inception_features</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(images, model, device</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'cuda'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    model.eval()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    features </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.no_grad():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> batch </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> images:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            batch </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> batch.to(device)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            feat </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model(batch)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            features.append(feat.cpu().numpy())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.concatenate(features)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>FID 的局限性包括：对样本数量敏感（通常需要至少 10000 张图像才能稳定），依赖 Inception 网络的特征空间（对非自然图像可能不合适），以及高斯假设在特征分布非高斯时引入误差。改进方案包括 KID（Kernel Inception Distance）使用核方法避免高斯假设，CMMD 使用 CLIP 特征替代 Inception 特征以获得更好的语义对齐。</p>\n<h2 id=\"inception-score-与条件熵分析\">Inception Score 与条件熵分析</h2><p>Inception Score（IS）基于两个直觉：高质量生成图像应该让分类器给出高置信度预测（低条件熵），同时生成图像集合应该涵盖多种类别（高边际熵）。IS = exp(E[KL(p(y|x) || p(y))])，其中 p(y|x) 是 Inception 网络对单张生成图像的类别预测分布，p(y) 是所有生成图像预测分布的平均。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph IS 计算流程&#10;        A[生成图像集合] --&gt; B[Inception-v3]&#10;        B --&gt; C[p_y_x 类别预测]&#10;        C --&gt; D[条件熵 H_y_x]&#10;        C --&gt; E[边际分布 p_y]&#10;        E --&gt; F[边际熵 H_y]&#10;        D --&gt; G[IS = exp H_y - H_y_x]&#10;        F --&gt; G&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph IS 计算流程\n        A[生成图像集合] --&gt; B[Inception-v3]\n        B --&gt; C[p_y_x 类别预测]\n        C --&gt; D[条件熵 H_y_x]\n        C --&gt; E[边际分布 p_y]\n        E --&gt; F[边际熵 H_y]\n        D --&gt; G[IS = exp H_y - H_y_x]\n        F --&gt; G\n    end</pre><p>IS 的问题在于它完全忽略了真实数据分布。一个只生成 1000 类中每类一张完美图像的模型可以获得很高的 IS，即使它与真实数据集毫无关系。此外，IS 对类内多样性不敏感，且与 ImageNet 类别体系绑定。因此，IS 通常作为辅助指标，主要用于验证生成样本是否包含可识别的语义内容。</p>\n<p>在实际评估中，IS 和 FID 经常一起使用。FID 关注分布匹配，IS 关注样本质量和类别覆盖。两个指标的趋势通常一致，但在极端情况下可能矛盾——例如模式崩塌到少数高质量样本时，IS 可能较高但 FID 很差。</p>\n<h2 id=\"precision-recall-与分布覆盖\">Precision-Recall 与分布覆盖</h2><p>Precision 和 Recall 在生成模型评估中被重新定义为分布层面的概念。Precision 衡量生成分布中有多少比例落入真实数据的支撑集（保真度），Recall 衡量真实数据分布中有多少比例被生成分布覆盖（多样性）。这种分解比 FID 更直观，能够独立诊断保真度和多样性的问题。</p>\n<p>Kynkäänniemi 等人提出了基于 k-NN 的 Precision/Recall 计算方法：在特征空间中，用 k 近邻定义每个样本的局部邻域。生成样本落入真实样本邻域的比例即为 Precision，真实样本落入生成样本邻域的比例即为 Recall。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import numpy as np&#10;from sklearn.neighbors import NearestNeighbors&#10;&#10;def compute_precision_recall(real_features, gen_features, k=5):&#10;    knn_real = NearestNeighbors(n_neighbors=k).fit(real_features)&#10;    knn_gen = NearestNeighbors(n_neighbors=k).fit(gen_features)&#10;    real_distances, _ = knn_real.kneighbors(real_features)&#10;    gen_distances, _ = knn_gen.kneighbors(gen_features)&#10;    real_radii = real_distances[:, -1]&#10;    gen_radii = gen_distances[:, -1]&#10;    dist_gen_to_real, idx_gen_to_real = knn_real.kneighbors(gen_features)&#10;    precision = np.mean(dist_gen_to_real[:, 0] &lt;= real_radii[idx_gen_to_real[:, 0]])&#10;    dist_real_to_gen, idx_real_to_gen = knn_gen.kneighbors(real_features)&#10;    recall = np.mean(dist_real_to_gen[:, 0] &lt;= gen_radii[idx_real_to_gen[:, 0]])&#10;    return precision, recall&#10;&#10;def compute_density_coverage(real_features, gen_features, k=5):&#10;    knn_real = NearestNeighbors(n_neighbors=k).fit(real_features)&#10;    real_distances, _ = knn_real.kneighbors(real_features)&#10;    real_radii = real_distances[:, -1]&#10;    dist_gen_to_real, idx_gen_to_real = knn_real.kneighbors(gen_features)&#10;    density = np.mean(&#10;        np.sum(dist_gen_to_real &lt;= real_radii[idx_gen_to_real], axis=1) / k&#10;    )&#10;    coverage = np.mean(&#10;        np.any(dist_gen_to_real &lt;= real_radii[idx_gen_to_real[:, :1]], axis=0)&#10;    )&#10;    return density, coverage\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.neighbors </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NearestNeighbors</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> compute_precision_recall</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(real_features, gen_features, k</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    knn_real </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NearestNeighbors(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n_neighbors</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">k).fit(real_features)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    knn_gen </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NearestNeighbors(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n_neighbors</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">k).fit(gen_features)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    real_distances, _ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> knn_real.kneighbors(real_features)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    gen_distances, _ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> knn_gen.kneighbors(gen_features)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    real_radii </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> real_distances[:, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    gen_radii </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gen_distances[:, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    dist_gen_to_real, idx_gen_to_real </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> knn_real.kneighbors(gen_features)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    precision </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.mean(dist_gen_to_real[:, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> real_radii[idx_gen_to_real[:, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    dist_real_to_gen, idx_real_to_gen </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> knn_gen.kneighbors(real_features)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    recall </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.mean(dist_real_to_gen[:, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gen_radii[idx_real_to_gen[:, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> precision, recall</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> compute_density_coverage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(real_features, gen_features, k</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    knn_real </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NearestNeighbors(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n_neighbors</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">k).fit(real_features)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    real_distances, _ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> knn_real.kneighbors(real_features)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    real_radii </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> real_distances[:, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    dist_gen_to_real, idx_gen_to_real </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> knn_real.kneighbors(gen_features)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    density </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.mean(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        np.sum(dist_gen_to_real </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> real_radii[idx_gen_to_real], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">axis</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> k</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    coverage </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.mean(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        np.any(dist_gen_to_real </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> real_radii[idx_gen_to_real[:, :</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">axis</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> density, coverage</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Density 和 Coverage 是对 Precision/Recall 的改进指标。Density 衡量生成样本在真实流形上的平均密度（检测模式崩塌），Coverage 衡量真实流形被至少一个生成样本覆盖的比例（检测模式缺失）。这些指标对异常值更加鲁棒，并且能够区分轻微的分布偏移和严重的模式崩塌。</p>\n<h2 id=\"clip-score-与语义对齐评估\">CLIP Score 与语义对齐评估</h2><p>随着文本条件生成模型的普及，文图一致性成为核心评估维度。CLIP Score 利用预训练的 CLIP 模型计算生成图像与输入文本之间的语义相似度。CLIP 将图像和文本映射到共享的嵌入空间，二者的余弦相似度反映语义对齐程度。</p>\n<p>CLIP Score = cos(CLIP_image(x), CLIP_text(c))，其中 x 是生成图像，c 是文本提示。更高的 CLIP Score 表示生成结果更好地遵循了文本描述。然而，CLIP Score 与 FID 之间存在内在张力：增大 Classifier-Free Guidance 强度会提高 CLIP Score（更严格遵循文本）但可能降低 FID（降低多样性、引入伪影）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>评估场景</th>\n<th>推荐指标组合</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>无条件图像生成</td>\n<td>FID + Precision/Recall</td>\n<td>综合衡量质量与多样性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文本到图像</td>\n<td>FID + CLIP Score + 人工评估</td>\n<td>兼顾分布匹配与文图一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图像编辑</td>\n<td>LPIPS + CLIP Direction</td>\n<td>衡量编辑精确性与保留度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超分辨率</td>\n<td>PSNR + SSIM + LPIPS</td>\n<td>像素级与感知级综合评估</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>视频生成</td>\n<td>FVD + IS + 时序一致性</td>\n<td>空间质量与时序连贯性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>人类评估仍然是生成质量的最终标准。常用的人工评估方案包括 A/B 偏好测试、MOS（Mean Opinion Score）评分和对齐性评分。为了减少主观性，评估通常采用大规模众包标注并进行评估者一致性分析。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((评估指标))&#10;    分布距离&#10;      FID&#10;      KID&#10;      CMMD&#10;    质量-多样性分解&#10;      Precision&#10;      Recall&#10;      Density / Coverage&#10;    条件一致性&#10;      CLIP Score&#10;      R-Precision&#10;    传统指标&#10;      IS&#10;      PSNR / SSIM&#10;      LPIPS&#10;    人工评估&#10;      A/B 测试&#10;      MOS 评分\">mindmap\n  root((评估指标))\n    分布距离\n      FID\n      KID\n      CMMD\n    质量-多样性分解\n      Precision\n      Recall\n      Density / Coverage\n    条件一致性\n      CLIP Score\n      R-Precision\n    传统指标\n      IS\n      PSNR / SSIM\n      LPIPS\n    人工评估\n      A/B 测试\n      MOS 评分</pre><ul>\n<li>FID 是最通用的生成质量指标，同时捕获保真度和多样性，但需要足够的样本量</li>\n<li>IS 衡量类别清晰度和覆盖度，但忽略真实数据分布，应作为辅助指标使用</li>\n<li>Precision/Recall 将生成质量分解为保真度和多样性两个独立维度，便于诊断问题</li>\n<li>CLIP Score 是文本条件生成的核心评估指标，但需注意与多样性的权衡</li>\n<li>不同生成任务应选择匹配的指标组合，人工评估始终是最终标准</li>\n<li>实际评估中需关注指标的样本量依赖性、特征空间选择和统计显著性</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"生成质量评估指标","id":"生成质量评估指标"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Fréchet Inception Distance","id":"fr-chet-inception-distance"},{"level":2,"text":"Inception Score 与条件熵分析","id":"inception-score-与条件熵分析"},{"level":2,"text":"Precision-Recall 与分布覆盖","id":"precision-recall-与分布覆盖"},{"level":2,"text":"CLIP Score 与语义对齐评估","id":"clip-score-与语义对齐评估"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"隐空间","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/generative-foundations/latent-space"},"next":{"title":"扩散过程的数学理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/diffusion-models/diffusion-theory"}}